WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.076 --> 00:00:01.076
- I hate Thai food.

00:00:01.076 --> 00:00:02.736
- I love Thai food.

00:00:03.219 --> 00:00:05.239
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.499 --> 00:00:09.453
- [Voiceover] This looks
like an egg sandwich.

00:00:09.453 --> 00:00:10.913
- It's like a little taco.

00:00:12.417 --> 00:00:14.451
- It tastes exactly like a fortune cookie.

00:00:14.451 --> 00:00:15.571
- Ooh it's got a ooh.

00:00:15.571 --> 00:00:17.395
Ooh it's got a ooh.

00:00:17.395 --> 00:00:19.575
It's like got a tangy orange flavor.

00:00:19.575 --> 00:00:20.799
- Is it coconut?

00:00:20.799 --> 00:00:21.819
Is it colored coconut?

00:00:22.412 --> 00:00:23.532
- No it's mine.

00:00:24.148 --> 00:00:25.628
- I'm not a big fortune cookie fan.

00:00:25.628 --> 00:00:27.009
I know that's ironic, but I'm not.

00:00:27.009 --> 00:00:28.609
- [Voiceover] What is happening?

00:00:28.609 --> 00:00:29.949
- [Voiceover] What's going on here?

00:00:29.949 --> 00:00:32.192
- I think we're gonna eat unicorn hair.

00:00:32.192 --> 00:00:33.052
- Ooh.

00:00:33.052 --> 00:00:34.212
- Interactive desserts.

00:00:34.212 --> 00:00:35.716
- Thai people are all about the tacos.

00:00:35.716 --> 00:00:37.196
- I think I just poked one up my nose.

00:00:37.196 --> 00:00:38.048
I'm really sorry.

00:00:38.048 --> 00:00:39.151
- [Both] Cheers.

00:00:39.151 --> 00:00:39.681
- I love this.

00:00:39.681 --> 00:00:40.565
- This is fun.

00:00:40.565 --> 00:00:42.925
- It melts in your mouth the
same way cotton candy does.

00:00:42.925 --> 00:00:44.185
- I feel like Rumpelstiltskin.

00:00:44.185 --> 00:00:44.979
Like, turn it to gold.

00:00:44.979 --> 00:00:45.899
No?

00:00:45.899 --> 00:00:47.402
(both giggling)

00:00:47.482 --> 00:00:49.142
- [Voiceover] This is (beeping) phallic.

00:00:49.142 --> 00:00:50.176
- What is Durian?

00:00:50.176 --> 00:00:52.616
- That's the thing that smells really bad.

00:00:52.616 --> 00:00:54.777
- You're not advertising this well.

00:00:54.777 --> 00:00:56.960
- Whoa no!

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:00.853
- It smells like mango puss throw up.

00:01:00.853 --> 00:01:02.133
- Oh it tastes great.

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:04.137
- It's like a gummy
bear that's turned evil.

00:01:04.137 --> 00:01:05.677
- Okay it does taste
better than it smells.

00:01:05.677 --> 00:01:08.420
- It's like a very tame
version of the smell.

00:01:09.494 --> 00:01:10.574
- Is it a pancake?

00:01:10.574 --> 00:01:11.694
(gibberish noise)

00:01:11.694 --> 00:01:13.394
- I love Taro Boba.

00:01:13.394 --> 00:01:14.672
- It smells like a doughnut.

00:01:15.711 --> 00:01:16.871
- Oh dear.

00:01:16.871 --> 00:01:17.716
- It is so good.

00:01:17.716 --> 00:01:18.551
(groaning)

00:01:18.551 --> 00:01:19.807
- Well okay.

00:01:19.807 --> 00:01:20.667
- Is that corn?

00:01:20.667 --> 00:01:22.347
- This thing may as well tell it's parents

00:01:22.347 --> 00:01:23.547
it's dropping out of high school.

00:01:23.547 --> 00:01:25.210
Cause it is disappointing me.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:27.270
- It's like an Almond
Joy without the chocolate

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:29.354
or the nut and with purple.

00:01:29.354 --> 00:01:30.934
- [Voiceover] Looks like salted poop.

00:01:30.934 --> 00:01:32.427
- Look at these little turds.

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:34.411
- Oh that's hard.

00:01:34.411 --> 00:01:35.311
- Its a seed.

00:01:35.311 --> 00:01:36.031
There's a seed.

00:01:36.031 --> 00:01:37.191
- Wait, what is going on?

00:01:37.191 --> 00:01:38.014
Is it spicy?

00:01:38.014 --> 00:01:38.978
Is it sweet?

00:01:39.606 --> 00:01:41.270
- Ugh ugh.

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:43.030
- Oh but now I'm kinda into it, okay.

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:44.610
- It's salty at first.

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:45.693
And then sweet.

00:01:45.693 --> 00:01:47.594
And then spicy.

00:01:47.594 --> 00:01:50.067
- Dessert is supposed to
be a treat after dinner.

00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:51.927
This is like a (beeping) you after dinner.

00:01:51.927 --> 00:01:53.250
- It took me for a joy ride.

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:56.930
It said, "Get in, shut
up, because I'm driving".

00:01:57.914 --> 00:01:59.787
- [Voiceover] This looks
like lunch, not dessert.

00:01:59.787 --> 00:02:01.928
- You have to work for
your dessert in Thailand.

00:02:01.928 --> 00:02:04.051
- What is in there?

00:02:04.051 --> 00:02:05.391
- It is a baby alien.

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:06.351
I knew it.

00:02:06.351 --> 00:02:07.945
- Oh there is banana in here.

00:02:07.945 --> 00:02:09.865
- This is a mushed up
banana inside of rice.

00:02:09.865 --> 00:02:10.805
(growling)

00:02:10.805 --> 00:02:11.688
- Oh my god!

00:02:11.688 --> 00:02:12.867
- Mmm, it's not bad.

00:02:12.867 --> 00:02:13.928
- I like that.

00:02:13.928 --> 00:02:16.988
- It's like rice pudding,
except a gummy bar.

00:02:16.988 --> 00:02:19.292
- Whenever you have anything
that looks like a taco

00:02:19.292 --> 00:02:21.846
or a burrito, you're killing it Thailand.

00:02:21.846 --> 00:02:23.647
- Not the biggest fan of the spices.

00:02:23.647 --> 00:02:24.947
- I am really wowed.

00:02:24.947 --> 00:02:25.930
- Two thumbs up.

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:28.590
- Nothing like Thailand.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:29.506
- So good.

00:02:29.506 --> 00:02:31.844
- Talking 'bout Thailand.

00:02:32.353 --> 00:02:37.353
So good so good so good, yeah.

00:02:37.538 --> 00:02:39.118
- Are you supposed to eat this part?

00:02:40.649 --> 00:02:42.649
- You might of just killed us!

00:02:43.608 --> 00:02:46.188
We're probably not supposed to eat these.

